<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises at Italy 30-yr BTP sale.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises at Italy 30-yr BTP sale.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a third tranche of 1.5 trillion lire worth of a 30-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (Btp) with a 7.25 pct coupon.</p>
<p>			 Nov 1, 2026	    Pvs</p>
<p> Net Yield	   6.95 pct		 6.77 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield	 7.94 pct		 7.74</p>
<p> Assigned price   93.70		    95.90</p>
<p> Bids		 2.877 trln lire</p>
<p> Assigned	   1.500 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparison is with the previous auction on February 13 of a second tranche of the 30-year Btp.</p>
</text>
